905-from datasets import load_dataset
906-
907-ds = load_dataset("disco-eth/WorldSpeech", "nl_nl", split="train")
908-
909-row = ds[0]
910-wav    = row["audio"]["array"]         
911-sr     = row["audio"]["sampling_rate"]
912-text   = row["human_transcript"]
913-snr    = row["snr"]
914-dnsmos = row["dnsmos_ovr"]
915-```
